			<div class="content" id="post-content-3720557">
									

<p>While I can see why some might say the murder mystery is not integral enough to the article for the contest, I personally think that making it any more central would have thrown off fair amount of the emotional build up to the piece, and possible have done away with the &quot;mystery&quot; part of the &quot;murder mystery.&quot;</p>
<p>As is, we have a lot of people who would have wanted the skip dead, both inside and outside the Foundation, and there is a very good case for all parties. That's a job well done.</p>
<p>+1 MMG.</p>

